<title>ITALY: Port conditions update - Italy -  Lloyds Shipping.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - Italy -  Lloyds Shipping.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>GENOA, Dec 30 - Six general cargo vessels and one tanker awaiting berths.</p>
<p>SAVONA, Dec 30 - No vessels waiting for normal berths or special berths.</p>
<p>LA SPEZIA, Dec 30 - No vessels awaiting berths.</p>
</text>
